;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "My_life_Without_Your_Love.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\コーヒー豆.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"<STYLE ID="1">Kogori-sama</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="2">Niimura-sama</STYLE>, such happy news for them."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―The two of them getting married at the same time, and expecting at the same time too. Life's really strange.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="2">Niimura-sama</STYLE> especially always longed for a family, so I'm happy too."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Right. All we can do for them is give them a little service like this, though.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Hm?<PG>
"Um... I might be about to do something I shouldn't..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―What's the matter?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"This..."
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―A gift envelope?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I haven't given them my own congratulations yet, so..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―You should put that away. 
{PAUSE ""}
If you did that, we'd have to do the same for the other customers too.<PG>
"You're right. I'll hold off after all."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―I understand wanting to congratulate them. But customers are equal, no matter what. 
{PAUSE ""}
Still, I'd like you to treasure that thoughtfulness and make it your spirit of service.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yes, of course."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Kanai... no, <STYLE ID="2">Niimura-sama</STYLE> got married, and now she's having a child...<PG>
"What is it?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―<STYLE ID="2">Niimura-sama</STYLE> lost her parents early, didn't she?
{PAUSE ""}
　She always longed for a family, they say.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yes..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―If she ever lost her family again, what would become of her, I wonder. 
{PAUSE ""}
This shop alone surely couldn't do enough for her.<PG>
"Oh, come on, you're overthinking it..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―I do know that. 
{PAUSE ""}
But I have this theory of mine that happiness that comes suddenly vanishes suddenly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"What's easily gained is easily lost. 
{PAUSE ""}
Easy come, easy go, right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―In <STYLE ID="2">Niimura-sama</STYLE>'s case, though, I'd say it's happiness she got by her own strength, not by luck... 
{PAUSE ""}
No, sorry, that was thoughtless at a time like this. 
{PAUSE ""}
Right now we have to give them our most sincere service from the heart. 
{PAUSE ""}
Okay, take this out, please!<PG>
"Wow, the Deluxe Afternoon Tea Set!
{PAUSE ""}
　Even I get lost staring at it when I carry it, my heart pounding."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Ha ha ha, well then, star girl, go deliver happiness to the two of them.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Okay!"
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
